Wrong (A): Nondeductibility for income tax purposes does not prevent a basis reduction. Both AAA and stock basis decrease for nondeductible expenses under the statute.
Wrong (C): Nondeductible expenses reduce, not increase, stock basis. There is no add-back mechanism for fines or penalties in the basis adjustment rules.
