  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 55(d), the MFS AMT exemption of $68,500 is reduced by 25% of AMTI exceeding $609,000. Fielding''s excess is $700,000 - $609,000 = $91,000; 25% of $91,000 = $22,750. The reduced exemption is $68,500 - $22,750 = $45,750.
