-- Q10908: Alternative Minimum Tax [medium/L3]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 55(a), AMT equals TMT minus regular tax: $12,000 - $10,000 = $2,000. Total tax before credits is $12,000. Under Section 26(a), nonrefundable personal credits can offset both regular tax and AMT, so the $3,000 credit reduces total tax to $9,000.
